{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Friday, September 17. Yesterday I spent the whole day on a trip to Carlstein, an old castle four hours from here, where old paintings still hang, but otherwise there is nothing to see; — this morning I visited the churches and galleries, partly repeating what I had seen before, and have finished my business, i.e., seeing the sights. Yesterday’s tour with its heat, as well as the heat this morning, had made me very weak and affected me; — lunch at Uncle’s house today restored me wonderfully. After the meal, Mr. O. took us by carriage to a very pleasant place of amusement — here all the foliage is still firm and green, although it has not rained for a long time. Tomorrow I shall dine with the same family again; I am very well with them and with their heartfelt, friendly reception..."}}],"created":1795080489,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":174,"prompt_tokens":272,"total_tokens":446,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-jthAD0l2WOk2T1inYTtAjtGMa0gIvLkb","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":272,"prompt_ms":422.03,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.5515808823529411,"prompt_per_second":644.5039452171646,"predicted_n":174,"predicted_ms":4120.585,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.818410404624277,"predicted_per_second":41.9843298949057}}